The Event dataclass in dfir_triage_pipeline/model.py is frozen and is a locked contract.
No field may be added, removed, renamed or retyped without a corresponding entry in
docs/contract-decisions.md.

All timestamps are timezone-aware UTC with zero offset. Never convert silently.
source_file is always a collection-relative POSIX string.
source_locator always derives from a record identifier, never a loop counter.

Python target is 3.11+. Use `from datetime import UTC` and reference `UTC` directly.
Never write `UTC = timezone.utc` — ruff UP017 rejects it.

If a test fails, do not fix it by editing model.py, timeline.py or parsers/base.py.
Report the failure and stop.

Do not generate parsers, modules or helper functions that were not requested.
